ToolCall->from_gemini reads functionCall.id (ToolCall.pm:135) but Role/Tools.pm:462-468 builds the Gemini ToolResult with name only and ToolResult::to_gemini emits no id. Two parallel calls to the same function (fc-1, fc-2) come back as two functionResponse parts with identical name and no id. Similarly ToolResult::to_ollama emits {role:tool,content} without tool_name (Ollama docs show tool_name on tool messages), so parallel results cannot be matched on Ollama native.

Repro: format_tool_results(gemini) for calls {id:fc-1,name:echo},{id:fc-2,name:echo} -> parts [{functionResponse:{name:echo,response:{result:r1}}},{functionResponse:{name:echo,response:{result:r2}}}].

Fix: pass id => functionCall.id into the Gemini ToolResult and emit functionResponse.id when non-empty; pass name into the Ollama ToolResult and emit tool_name. Advisor check on current Gemini/Ollama docs first (documentation-derived).

